nt cities, and then he says to the people that if anything goes against that, If anything goes against the ORIGINAL -literally- then burn it And like I said, the original Quran is already memorised in the hearts of hundreds of thousands of people", "So How is it rationally possible? Under what planet for 'Uthman to change the Quran and do controlled editing? It's obviously such an absurd claim, and it cannot be more absurd And like I said, it's in our tradition, the Narrations mentioned Zayd bin Thabit, 'Uthman calling Zayd bin Thabit, the same person, and asking him to bring the copies, and making a copy of it All of that is in our tradition So there's no such thing as controlled editing! Now, obviously, he knows that the only controlled editing–it's not even the non-controlled editing, Or the uncontrolled editing happened to the Bible, and he knows that very well, as he's a Christian, We are having all of these different versions of the Bible: 66, 73, 82 books, all of these different versions He knows that is the uncontrolled editing, so he -somehow- is trying to impose that on Islam. But anyway, we are answering his \"five points\"",))
