ays: یُكَوِّرُ ٱلَّیۡلَ عَلَى ٱلنَّهَارِ وَیُكَوِّرُ ٱلنَّهَارَ عَلَى ٱلَّیۡلِۖ So, (Allah circles..) the word: يُكَوِّرُ comes from the Arabic word كُرة (Ball) So, Allah says (He circles the night over the day and He circles the day over the night) and that can only happen if the Earth is ROUND, in which you can go with the night and the day in a circular motion So, when Allah says He circles the night over the day and He circles the day over the night, Is this my understanding?", "No! This is the understanding way before NASA existed, way before satellites, way before we could see the shape of the Earth. You have Shaykh alIslam Ibn Taymiyyah, and you have many many Scholars in Islam You have Ibn Hazm, People who lived in Andalusia, people who lived -we're talking about 400, 500 or 600 years back from today- who reported the consensus of Muslim scholars that the Earth is round And, what did they use as evidence? they used this verse! And they said from this verse we come to the understanding that the Earth is round and also Ibn Hazm says: \"I have not known ANY person, ANY scholar of knowledge that goes against this opinion\" So, not only the Quran is not saying the Earth is flat, but before YOU, and before all your \"scientific NASA people\" try to tell us about \"We're so knowledgeable today\" We have this information in our classical text 600, 700, 800 years before you", "So, there is nothing new being presented. And bear in mind! When the Muslims believed that, the overwhelming majority of people used to believe it's flat! So Muslims stood on that opinion because the Quran says so. And it said against what? \"science\" and what people thought at the time, but the Quran was correct And today we know THE QURAN IS CORRECT So, let's see what else you have to present Again, as I said, most of these things you're going to present are actually evidences FOR ISLAM, and evidences against you as an atheist",))
